 <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#cc6666;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"><em>Forever can never be long enough for me, to feel like I've had long enough with you...19\/01\/2016<\/em><\/span><\/span>","Email":"kimberlydiana@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.76.172.36","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412304687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280238.png?_r=1412619945","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":60,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kimmyd2","Id":280238,"Name":"kimmyd2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.104.201.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05b6996be97b57818ea3b7c62f9cf00d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI Amanda! Cognrats! Good luck with the wedding planning&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874914,"PostDate":1412865713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI Amanda! Cognrats! Good luck with the wedding planning<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candicecchau@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.104.201.70","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412863401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280416.png?_r=1412865762","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Candyyy","Id":280416,"Name":"Candyyy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.157.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"656ec9f9d8deb0387d61e6123fd5a1e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome @[member=\"amandankeith\"] ! So exciting planning a wedding to your best friend! One piece of advice, start another email account now that you will deal with all wedding stuff, keeps it out of your day to day. I have a gmail account that my FI and I share and both have to our phones so that we know both stay in the loop!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874956,"PostDate":1412879008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome @amandankeith ! So exciting planning a wedding to your best friend! One piece of advice, start another email account now that you will deal with all wedding stuff, keeps it out of your day to day. I have a gmail account that my FI and I share and both have to our phones so that we know both stay in the loop!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412130898,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.185.215.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f7e60c9a372d0b0c9adc5f6a3d46a7a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"amandankeith\" post=\"1872971\" timestamp=\"1411569729\"]\nHello Everyone,\n\nMy name is amanda I am 28 years old recently engaged to the man of my dreams. He asked me to marry him in Istanbul, Turkey on September 9th. We decided on a destination wedding after attending his cousins in 2012. We really had a great time and I like the no fuss kind of idea. I stumbled upon this website and I haven&#039;t been able to get off. Looking forward to reading all of your posts and getting to know you girls.\n\nThanks for reading and I&#039;m sure I&#039;ll see you around,\nAmanda[\/quote]Congrats on your engagement Amanda,\n\nYou have found the right place for a DW! have you decided on a location, Riviera Maya has plenty of options for you from hotel\/villa or private locations.  feel free to reach out and we will be happy to help.\n\nHappy Planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1875421,"PostDate":1413152104,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>amandankeith, on 24 September 2014 - 06:42 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My name is amanda I am 28 years old recently engaged to the man of my dreams. He asked me to marry him in Istanbul, Turkey on September 9th. We decided on a destination wedding after attending his cousins in 2012. We really had a great time and I like the no fuss kind of idea. I stumbled upon this website and I haven't been able to get off. Looking forward to reading all of your posts and getting to know you girls.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for reading and I'm sure I'll see you around,<\/p>\n<p>Amanda<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Congrats on your engagement Amanda,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You have found the right place for a DW! have you decided on a location, Riviera Maya has plenty of options for you from hotel\/villa or private locations. \u00a0feel free to reach out and we will be happy to help.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.40.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78081,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8dac185189e0e82044d52a8625951b34","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"amandankeith\"] Congrats! That is so awesome! I&#039;m dying to go to Istanbul!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875761,"PostDate":1413345103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@amandankeith Congrats! That is so awesome! I'm dying to go to Istanbul!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407874186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"41.218.230.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted"